---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Disclosure" description="How Drink Memphis Beer handles sponsors, affiliate links, images and accuracy.">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 prose-dmb">
    <h1 class="text-7xl">Disclosure</h1>
    <h2>Independence</h2>
    <p>Drink Memphis Beer is independent and not affiliated with any brewery. Brewery and beer names are used to describe and review them; they belong to their owners.</p>
    <h2>Sponsors and affiliate links</h2>
    <p>Some pages may include sponsored sections or affiliate links, which earn us a small commission at no cost to you. They're always labeled. Sponsors never affect a Pour Score or a review.</p>
    <h2>Images</h2>
    <p>Some images on this site are AI-generated illustrations and are labeled "Illustration." Photos of specific breweries, beers, events and sightings are real photos. We never use AI to show a real brewery's products or places as if they were real.</p>
    <h2>Accuracy</h2>
    <p>Breweries change hours, beers and owners often. Every status shows when we last checked it. Always confirm hours on the brewery's own site, and <a href="/contact/">tell us</a> if something's wrong.</p>
    <h2>Drink responsibly</h2>
    <p>This site is for adults 21 and over. Take a ride home.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
